== Icelandic ==

=== Adverb ===

'''ennþá'''

# [[still]]
#: ''Ég er '''ennþá''' latur, en ég [[taka til|tek]] samt oft [[taka til|til]] í herberginu mínu.''
#:: I'm '''still''' lazy, but I do [[clean]] my room though often. 
#: ''Ég [[kunna á|kann]] '''ennþá''' ekki [[kunna á|á]] [[tölva|tölvur]].''
#:: I '''still''' don't know how to [[operate]] [[computer]]s.

